<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - America Online started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - America Online started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it initiated coverage of America Online Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available. The analyst, Alan Braverman, was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- America Online gained 1-3/4 to 38-5/8 in morning trading.</p>
